<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row mt-5 mb-5">
  <div class="col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-8 offset-lg-2">
    <div class="card p-5 shadow-sm border-0 bg-light rounded-4">
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-dark"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved me-2 text-danger"></i> Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-muted">Last Updated: May 2026</p>
      <hr class="mb-4">

      <h3 class="mt-4 h5 fw-bold">1. Information We Collect</h3>
      <p>We collect personal information that you provide to us when creating an account, posting listings, or commenting reviews, including email address, username, and account profile details.</p>

      <h3 class="mt-4 h5 fw-bold">2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
      <p>We use your information to operate, provide, improve, and personalize the Wanderlust platform. This includes listing properties, verifying user identities, and managing secure communications.</p>

      <h3 class="mt-4 h5 fw-bold">3. Security of Your Data</h3>
      <p>We implement industry-standard administrative, technical, and physical security measures to protect your personal details against unauthorized access, loss, or alteration.</p>

      <h3 class="mt-4 h5 fw-bold">4. Your Rights</h3>
      <p>You have the right to request deletion of your account and related listings, modify your details, or opt-out of transactional and marketing updates at any time.</p>

      <div class="mt-5">
        <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-danger rounded-pill px-4 py-2">Back to Explore</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
